# Deliberately no `text` or `eol` rules.
#
# A blanket `* text=auto eol=lf` re-normalizes the entire tree whenever the
# active .gitattributes changes. Because this file exists on some branches and
# not others, that turns every branch switch into a wall of phantom
# modifications and aborts rebases. Every tracked file here is already LF, and
# no .bat or .cmd files are tracked, so the rules bought nothing.
#
# Line endings are handled by .editorconfig instead, which applies when a file
# is edited rather than when it is checked out.

# Binary: never diff, never normalize.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.jar    binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks    binary
*.apk    binary
*.aab    binary

# Generated: collapse in diffs and exclude from language statistics.
*.lock linguist-generated
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java linguist-generated

# The example app is a demonstration, not the substance of the package.
example/** linguist-documentation
